{"w":2400,"h":3406,"lines":[{"c":1,"t":"Test 4","h":0.014679976512037562,"w":0.065979379018147766,"x":0.8927835062709949,"y":0.047856723352925012},{"h":0.010174418083724102,"x":0.063917526370398672,"c":1,"w":0.094845358530680338,"t":"SUPERVISOR:","y":0.09447674427693642},{"c":1,"x":0.15876289679116995,"w":0.36701029459635415,"y":0.091569767477925335,"h":0.015988371754420694,"t":"And they were quite young, weren't they?"},{"y":0.11150655026865652,"t":"JOANNA:","h":0.0095450389546222203,"c":1,"x":0.061747505918991939,"w":0.064133853912353489},{"y":0.10700072006487094,"t":"Yes, between 25 and 29 - the mean was 27.8. I wasn't specifically looking for","c":1,"x":0.17310562765736373,"h":0.018168137483714375,"w":0.65993515014648441},{"w":0.64754999796549484,"y":0.12356668272866822,"c":1,"x":0.17313924558607777,"t":"artists who'd produced recordings, but this is something that's just taken for.","h":0.017446818102547113},{"h":0.014679976512037562,"t":"granted these days, and they all had.","y":0.14092777472457008,"x":0.17319587939972461,"c":1,"w":0.3175257619222005},{"y":0.1598837210635774,"w":0.096907215118408205,"c":1,"x":0.063917526355978652,"h":0.0087209299460482281,"t":"SUPERVISOR:"},{"c":1,"t":"JOANNA:","h":0.0087209299460482281,"x":0.061855671671387974,"y":0.1773255815235677,"w":0.063917522430419926},{"w":0.6536082458496093,"c":1,"y":0.15697674435279385,"t":"Right. Now you collected your data through telephone interviews, didn't you?","x":0.17113402130265817,"h":0.015988371754420583},{"y":0.17135575637725697,"w":0.6785065205891927,"t":"Yes. Lrealised if I was going to interview leading musicians it'd only be possible.","x":0.17518717823129046,"h":0.019081395720987437,"c":1},{"h":0.016694907223695377,"t":"over the phone because they're so busy. I recorded them using a telephone","x":0.17313037735923673,"y":0.18857436882154799,"w":0.64136784871419272,"c":1},{"x":0.1731958939647934,"y":0.20493247199147446,"c":1,"t":"recording adaptor. I'd been worried about the quality, but it worked out all","w":0.61855667114257806,"h":0.014679976512037562},{"t":"right. I managed at least a 30-minute interview with each subject, sometimes","y":0.22225484446785582,"c":1,"x":0.17113402811612616,"w":0.65154637654622394,"h":0.014679976512037562},{"t":"longer.","h":0.013618505078067722,"y":0.23846502093332589,"c":1,"x":0.17257427528967589,"w":0.060908374786376979},{"y":0.25581395362148651,"h":0.0087209299460482281,"c":1,"x":0.06391752727594642,"w":0.09278350194295247,"t":"SUPERVISOR:"},{"c":1,"x":0.061661188642617062,"h":0.010323162157257038,"y":0.2712624201696594,"w":0.066338704427083325,"t":"JOANNA:"},{"c":1,"x":0.173117819385016,"t":"Did doing it on the phone make it more stressful?","y":0.25278131505711809,"w":0.41667465209960941,"h":0.016420308940213291},{"w":0.65567006429036456,"h":0.014534883616744709,"c":1,"t":"I'd thought it might... it was all quite informal though and in fact they seemed","x":0.17319590166925053,"y":0.268895348647054},{"t":"very keen to talk. And I don't think using the phone meant got less rich data,","x":0.17107960029181668,"h":0.017523616044855861,"c":1,"y":0.2848356392778032,"w":0.66404006958007811},{"t":"rather the opposite in fact.","x":0.17113401500243816,"y":0.30232558143889166,"w":0.22474227905273439,"h":0.014534883616744709,"c":1},{"x":0.063917527289511306,"h":0.0087209299460482281,"c":1,"t":"SUPERVISOR:","w":0.092783501942952484,"y":0.31976744199224516},{"y":0.31826189064821075,"h":0.014679976512037562,"c":1,"w":0.59381444295247399,"t":"Interesting. And you were looking at how performers dress for concert","x":0.17113401553371299},{"h":0.013054562678983861,"c":1,"y":0.33300312979375291,"x":0.1729139398381605,"t":"performances?","w":0.13035926818847654},{"x":0.06185567167607401,"h":0.010174418083723991,"t":"JOANNA:","y":0.35174418628385151,"w":0.063917522430419954,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"That's right My research investigated the way players see their role as a","x":0.17113401460269681,"h":0.016147974163241319,"y":0.3487962421559232,"w":0.61649485270182292},{"t":"musician and how this is linked to the type of clothing they decide to wear. But","y":0.36627906981702862,"c":1,"x":0.17113403127011509,"w":0.66597935994466151,"h":0.014534883616744709},{"t":"that focus didn't emerge immediately. When I started I was more interested in","c":1,"x":0.17106169602020402,"y":0.38074430291391814,"w":0.66404205322265619,"h":0.018395171890662088},{"x":0.16907216562830427,"t":"irving to investigate the impact of what was worn on those listening, and also","c":1,"h":0.016147974163241319,"w":0.6536082458496093,"y":0.39812096300367372},{"t":"whether someone like a violinist might adopt a different style of clothing from..","w":0.6640342712402344,"x":0.1710884694034244,"h":0.017395950245703173,"c":1,"y":0.41285953339100889},{"t":"say, someone playing the flute or the trumpet","w":0.38762886047363287,"y":0.43012331162101514,"c":1,"x":0.17113402409308046,"h":0.014679976512037562},{"x":0.061855671147030951,"y":0.44912790711008899,"w":0.094845358530680351,"t":"SUPERVISOR:","h":0.0087209299460482281,"c":1},{"x":0.061832653603098052,"y":0.46503455300360685,"h":0.0088843823319243453,"c":1,"t":"JOANNA:","w":0.061901702880859368},{"h":0.015988371754420472,"c":1,"w":0.57731959025065105,"x":0.17113401920531848,"y":0.44622093039896304,"t":"It's interesting that the choice of dress is up to the individual, isn't it?"},{"x":0.1731958820737691,"h":0.016147974163241319,"c":1,"y":0.46212566082669837,"t":"Yes, you'd expect there to be rules about it in orchestras, but that's quite rare.","w":0.65979380289713541},{"t":"suPERvisor: You only had women performers in your study. Was that because male","x":0.06185566475599117,"y":0.50290697667628692,"w":0.70927836100260422,"h":0.013081395479068947,"c":1},{"h":0.013211978860833917,"t":"musicians are less worried about fashion?","x":0.16907216721547361,"y":0.51879037011356655,"c":1,"w":0.36082473754882816},{"w":0.064040934244791667,"h":0.010566174948978491,"c":1,"t":"JOANNA:","x":0.059732110034491109,"y":0.53614133108676876},{"c":1,"t":"I think a lot of the men are very much influenced by fashion, but in social terms.","y":0.53186892052355239,"w":0.67854303995768228,"x":0.16898635928321928,"h":0.019039113732974622},{"h":0.013081395479068947,"t":"Q27","y":0.53488372082877944,"w":0.039175256093343047,"x":0.8639175264951382,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.16907217376086683,"h":0.014679976512037562,"t":"the choices they have are more limited.. they'c really upset audiences if they.","w":0.67422678629557298,"y":0.55079271858586287},{"x":0.1690010305273639,"h":0.01600488717599402,"c":1,"y":0.56544893338467883,"t":"strayed away from quite narrow boundaries.","w":0.37544657389322911},{"t":"SUPERVISOR:","w":0.09278350194295247,"y":0.58430232582974651,"h":0.010174418083723991,"c":1,"x":0.06185567160338877},{"t":"Hmm. Now, popular music has quite difrerent expectations. Did you read Mike","y":0.5827950674995237,"h":0.014679976512037562,"x":0.16494846425381457,"w":0.6659793599446614,"c":1},{"t":"Frost's article about the dress of women performers in popular music?","y":0.59883720923493067,"w":0.59381444295247388,"c":1,"x":0.1711340155344315,"h":0.013081395479069058},{"h":0.0088611385504497875,"c":1,"x":0.059774682111833261,"t":"JOANNA:","y":0.61766245396525021,"w":0.063955790201822918},{"h":0.010174418083723991,"y":0.63226744210881625,"x":0.061855671142121788,"t":"SUPERVISOR:","w":0.094845358530680351,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"No.","x":0.16731020890939652,"w":0.038600603739420564,"h":0.016573310668371977,"y":0.61372660440596793},{"x":0.16907216766301217,"y":0.62936046492612374,"h":0.01453488361674482,"c":1,"w":0.68247421264648445,"t":"He points out that a lot of female singers and musicians in popular music tend to"},{"y":0.64679976488349888,"x":0.16907217375943001,"c":1,"h":0.015990932619158738,"t":"dress down in performances, and wear less feminine clothes, like jeans instead","w":0.67422678629557287},{"w":0.73414449055989572,"x":0.16901010390701429,"t":"of skirts, and he suggests this is because otherwise they'd just be discounted as. Q28","c":1,"h":0.018978479534335069,"y":0.66125843225576364},{"y":0.69759754939125196,"h":0.0088746686298148969,"x":0.06183400782501651,"c":1,"t":"JOANNA:","w":0.06189899444580077},{"w":0.094845358530680324,"c":1,"t":"SUPERVISOR:","x":0.061855671144739999,"y":0.72965116292426258,"h":0.0087209299460482281},{"t":"JOANNA:","x":0.059762920132248223,"y":0.77750252371726991,"h":0.008948440910155786,"c":1,"w":0.063979314168294263},{"c":1,"t":"SUPERVISOR:","x":0.061855671603500327,"w":0.092783501942952457,"y":0.84156976757520541,"h":0.0087209299460482281},{"c":1,"h":0.0089556559071565234,"w":0.063981246948242185,"x":0.059761953738578177,"t":"JOANNA:","y":0.85744077668240382},{"c":1,"t":"SUPERVISOR:","x":0.061855671629407423,"w":0.092783501942952484,"y":0.88953488385172674,"h":0.0087209299460482281},{"x":0.05979381599784845,"y":0.90697674431476649,"w":0.063917522430419926,"h":0.0087209299460482281,"c":1,"t":"JOANNA:"},{"c":1,"t":"But you could argue they're just wearing what's practical... I mean, a pop-music","x":0.1690721719421748,"w":0.68247421264648434,"h":0.016147974163241319,"y":0.69465648876810537},{"h":0.01453488361674482,"c":1,"w":0.35670102437337237,"x":0.1690721686989746,"t":"concert is usually a pretty energetic affair.","y":0.71075581397254739},{"h":0.016147974163241319,"x":0.1690721716547203,"t":"Yes, he doesn't make that point, but I think you're probably right. I was","c":1,"y":0.72665883712149437,"w":0.5979381306966145},{"x":0.16907215514866106,"y":0.74273255818887485,"c":1,"h":0.01453488361674482,"w":0.67216496785481772,"t":"interested by the effect of the audience at a musical performance when it came"},{"x":0.1689016305879302,"h":0.01427475284704105,"w":0.19211146036783858,"y":0.75759657103982769,"t":"to the choice of dress.","c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.01453488361674482,"x":0.16907216379331033,"w":0.66185567220052077,"t":"The subjects I interviewed felt this was really important. It's all to do with what","y":0.77470930237532221},{"t":"we understand by performance as a public event. They believed the audience.","x":0.16907216888113122,"y":0.79066353494561603,"c":1,"h":0.016147974163241319,"w":0.66804122924804688},{"y":0.80478465747813166,"w":0.64359939575195313,"h":0.019400605018602302,"t":"had certain expectations and it was up to them as performers to fulfil these.","x":0.16893228991089682,"c":1},{"y":0.82144910420215245,"t":"expectations, to show a kind of esteem","x":0.16897781510361709,"w":0.35278935750325524,"c":1,"h":0.0159216279921921},{"w":0.60618555704752608,"t":".. they weren't afraid of looking as if they'd made an effort to look good.","x":0.17525773683889612,"y":0.83852025827357946,"h":0.016147974163241319,"c":1},{"x":0.16907215383419186,"c":1,"w":0.64948455810546879,"h":0.01453488361674482,"t":"Mmm. I think in the past the audience would have had those expectations of","y":0.85465116284047582},{"y":0.87052260711720053,"t":"one another too, but that's not really the case now, not in the UK anyway.","w":0.62061854044596354,"c":1,"x":0.17113403064862087,"h":0.016147974163241319},{"x":0.16248605793098786,"h":0.012519852105687734,"y":0.88806083506968814,"t":"No.","w":0.040529502232869469,"c":1},{"t":"And I also got interested in what sports scientists are doing too, with regard to","y":0.90399295342640396,"h":0.016147974163241319,"x":0.1690721637950052,"w":0.66185567220052077,"c":1},{"h":0.015981930672807398,"y":0.91911348015627481,"w":0.075513337453206375,"t":"clothing.","c":1,"x":0.1685202665350774},{"c":1,"t":"Q29","w":0.039175256093343047,"x":0.86185567082575121,"h":0.013081395479068947,"y":0.78924418594051637},{"w":0.082544129689534507,"y":0.10890143616151438,"t":"Q21 & 22","h":0.013301778805654862,"c":1,"x":0.86594442989494835},{"c":1,"t":"Q23 & 24","w":0.082543404897054029,"y":0.17285607644631096,"x":0.86594479229383337,"h":0.013299474979384884},{"w":0.082626101175944044,"y":0.28606384449531652,"t":"Q23 & 24","x":0.86590344415410636,"h":0.012174636563061947,"c":1},{"t":"Q25 & 26","y":0.38024613246290162,"h":0.014217037351006878,"c":1,"x":0.86580533972426077,"w":0.082822310129801346},{"h":0.013921420712787347,"w":0.082734603881835955,"x":0.86584919280171413,"c":1,"y":0.41382417334627419,"t":"Q25 & 26"},{"t":"leltsresources.org","x":0.35215793111227534,"h":0.0241128134153481,"w":0.29359642028808597,"c":1,"y":0.9528574896638341},{"w":0.039175256093343158,"t":"121","c":1,"x":0.9113402069533284,"y":0.95203488370034861,"h":0.01453488361674482}]}